        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "97f5b02c-7452-5866-92a1-4ba9ee74c80a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: NBA 2K16, NBA 2K17\n- People: Tony Parker, Dennis Schröder, Marc Gasol, Pau Gasol\n- Companies/Organizations: San Antonio Spurs, Atlanta Hawks, Memphis Grizzlies, Chicago Bulls\n- Roles: cover athletes, point guard\n- Topics: NBA 2K franchise installments\n\nFacts:\n- NBA 2K16 has regional cover athletes: Tony Parker for the French version, Dennis Schröder for the German version, and Marc Gasol and Pau Gasol for the Spanish version.\n- Tony Parker was with the San Antonio Spurs when he was featured as the French cover athlete for NBA 2K16.\n- Dennis Schröder was with the Atlanta Hawks when he was featured as the German cover athlete for NBA 2K16.\n- Marc Gasol and Pau Gasol were with the Memphis Grizzlies and Chicago Bulls respectively when they were featured on the Spanish version of NBA 2K16.\n- Dennis Schröder plays the point guard position.\n- NBA 2K17 is the 18th installment in the NBA 2K franchise and is the successor to NBA 2K16.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
