        "text": "Page: NBA 2K16. Sentence: Additionally, the French version of \"NBA 2K16\" features Tony Parker of the San Antonio Spurs as the cover athlete, the German version, Dennis Schröder of the Atlanta Hawks, and the Spanish version, Marc and Pau Gasol of the Memphis Grizzlies and Chicago Bulls respectively.\nPage: Dennis Schröder. Sentence: Standing at 6 ft , he plays at the point guard position.\nPage: NBA 2K17. Sentence: It is the 18th installment in the \"NBA 2K\" franchise and the successor to \"NBA 2K16\".",
